# 創刻のアテリアル's opening: the logo, the title, Game Start and the first pages of SC0000. It is the scenario of
# the game's P2 gate (docs/adding-a-game.md, step 6): native AGE and the port both pass it since 2026-11-19, at the
# same VM positions. Game Start goes straight to SC0000: the game has no new-game page. SC0000 opens with a white
# screen, "Eushully Presents..." and the message window, about 18 s in all, before its first page waits at
# SC0000@0xfff.
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native run tools/drive/scenarios/arterial-opening.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native stop
# The first click skips the logo. The title is not clicked while waiting for it: the middle of the canvas, where
# `advance` clicks, is the title's Game Start.

rand-seed 13
wait 5
click adv.next
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=90
wait 6
shot arterial-opening-title
click title.start
wait-state top=SC0000@0xfff timeout=90
settle timeout=20
shot arterial-opening-page1
advance 3
expect top=SC0000@0x12cf
shot arterial-opening-page4
